     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"de\" lang=\"de\"><hr/><p><b>German</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap mii-cm-onko-operation-komplikation-sct</b></p><a name=\"mii-cm-onko-operation-komplikation-sct\"> </a><a name=\"hcmii-cm-onko-operation-komplikation-sct\"> </a><p>Mapping from https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/ext/modul-onko/ to http://snomed.info/sct/900000000000207008/version/20240401</p><br/><p>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-mii-cs-onko-operation-komplikation.html\">MII CS Onkologie Operation Komplikationen</a> to <code>http://snomed.info/sct/900000000000207008/version/20240401</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>N (nein)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373067005 (No (qualifier value))</td><td>sollte nicht gemeinsam mit anderen Antworten vergeben werden</td></tr><tr><td>U (unbekannt)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>261665006 (Unknown (qualifier value))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>ABD (Abszess in einem Drainagekanal)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>128477000 (Abscess (disorder))</td><td>Abzsess in Drainagekanal existiert nicht als Konzept, kann ggfs. über Postkoordination konstruiert werden</td></tr><tr><td>ABS (Abszess, intraabdominaler oder intrathorakaler)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>75100008 (Abdominal abscess (disorder))</td><td>kein spezifischer Code für diese 'oder'-Konstruktion, daher spezifisch entweder Abdominal oder thorarical Abzess</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>405950009 (Abscess of thorax (disorder))</td><td>kein spezifischer Code für diese 'oder'-Konstruktion, daher spezifisch entweder Abdominal oder thorarical Abzess</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>128477000 (Abscess (disorder))</td><td>weiterfassend als Abszess kodiert</td></tr><tr><td>ASF (Abszess, subfaszialer)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>128477000 (Abscess (disorder))</td><td>keine englische Expression für die Spezifizierung subfaszial gefunden</td></tr><tr><td>ANI (Akute Niereninsuffizienz)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>723189000 (Acute renal insufficiency (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>AEP (Alkoholentzugspsychose)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>8635005 (Alcohol withdrawal delirium (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>ALR (Allergische Reaktion ohne Schocksymptomatik)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>419076005 (Allergic reaction (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>ANS (Anaphylaktischer Schock)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>735173007 (Shock due to anaphylaxis (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>AEE (Anastomoseninsuffizienz einer Enterostomie)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">kein äquivalenter SNOMED-Term, ggfs. über Postkoordination möglich</td></tr><tr><td>API (Apoplektischer Insult)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>230690007 (Cerebrovascular accident (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>BIF (Biliäre Fistel)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>53206008 (Fistula of bile duct (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>BOG (Blutung, obere gastrointestinale (z. B „Stressulkus“))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>37372002 (Upper gastrointestinal hemorrhage (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>BOE (Bolusverlegung eines Endotubus)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">kein äquivalenter SNOMED-Term, ggfs. über Postkoordination möglich</td></tr><tr><td>BSI (Bronchusstumpfinsuffizienz)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">kein äquivalenter SNOMED-Term, ggfs. über Postkoordination möglich</td></tr><tr><td>CHI (Cholangitis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>82403002 (Cholangitis (disorder) )</td><td/></tr><tr><td>DAI (Darmanastomoseninsuffizienz)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>236091002 (Large intestine anastomotic leak (disorder))</td><td>kein SNOMED-Term für Gesamtdarm-Anastomoseninsuffizienz</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>236090001 (Small intestine anastomotic leak (disorder))</td><td>kein SNOMED-Term für Gesamtdarm-Anastomoseninsuffizienz</td></tr><tr><td>DPS (Darmpassagestörungen (z. B. protrahierte Atonie, Subileus, Ileus))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>81060008 (Intestinal obstruction (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>DIC (Disseminierte intravasale Koagulopathie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>67406007 (Disseminated intravascular coagulation (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>DEP (Drogenentzugspsychose)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>772133000 (Recreational drug misuse withdrawal (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>DLU (Druck- und Lagerungsschäden, z. B. Dekubitalulzera)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1163215007 (Pressure injury (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>DSI (Duodenalstumpfinsuffizienz)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>236089005 (Duodenal stump leak (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>ENF (Enterale Fistel)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>735426009 (Fistula of digestive system (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>GER (Gerinnungsstörung)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>64779008 (Blood coagulation disorder (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HEM (Hämatemesis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>8765009 (Hematemesis (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HUR (Hämaturie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>34436003 (Blood in urine (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HAE (Hämorrhagischer Schock)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>355001 (Hemorrhagic shock (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HFI (Harnfistel)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>57243009 (Urinary fistula (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HNK (Hautnekrose im Operationsbereich)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>95347000 (Skin necrosis (disorder))</td><td>äquivalent insofern, als das im FHIR-Modell nach Komplikationen der OP gefragt wird; ansonsten ggfs. Spezifizierung über Postkoordination</td></tr><tr><td>HZI (Herzinsuffizienz)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>84114007 (Heart failure (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HRS (Herzrhythmusstörungen)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>698247007 (Cardiac arrhythmia (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HNA (Hirnnervenausfälle)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>73013002 (Cranial nerve disorder (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HOP (Hirnorganisches Psychosyndrom (z. B. „Durchgangssyndrom“))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>2776000 (Delirium (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HYB (Hyperbilirubinämie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>14783006 (Hyperbilirubinemia (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>HYF (Hypopharynxfistel)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>126663003 (Disorder of hypopharynx (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>IFV (Ileofemorale Venenthrombose)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>234044007 (Iliofemoral deep vein thrombosis (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>KAS (Kardiogener Schock)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>89138009 (Cardiogenic shock (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>KES (Komplikationen einer Stomaanlage)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">kein äquivalenter SNOMED-Term, ggfs. über Postkoordination möglich</td></tr><tr><td>KIM (Komplikation eines Implantates (Gefäßprothese, Totalendoprothese, Katheter), z. B. Dislokation)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>19220005 (Complication of implant (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>KRA (Krampfanfall)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>91175000 (Seizure (finding))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>KDS (Kurzdarmsyndrom)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>26629001 (Short bowel syndrome (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>LEV (Leberversagen)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>59927004 (Hepatic failure (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>LOE (Lungenödem)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>19242006 (Pulmonary edema (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>LYF (Lymphfistel)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>234105001 (Lymph fistula (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>LYE (Lymphozele)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>234109007 (Lymphocele (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>MES (Magenentleerungsstörung)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>386211005 (Disorder of function of stomach (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>MIL (Mechanischer Ileus)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>46420000 (Mechanical ileus (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>MED (Mediastinitis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>373409004 (Inflammatory disorder of mediastinum (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>MAT (Mesenterialarterien- oder -venenthrombose)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>243410003 (Thrombosis of mesenteric artery (disorder))</td><td>es existiert weder das gemeinsame noch ein für Mesenterialvenenthrombose spezifisches Konzept in SNOMED</td></tr><tr><td>NIN (Nahtinsuffizienz, anderweitig nicht erwähnt)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">kein äquivalenter SNOMED-Term, ggfs. über Postkoordination möglich</td></tr><tr><td>MYI (Myokardinfarkt)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>22298006 (Myocardial infarction (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>RNB (Nachblutung, revisionsbedürftig, anderweitig nicht erwähnt)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>308896002 (Secondary hemorrhage postprocedure (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>NAB (Nachblutung, nicht revisionsbedürftig, anderweitig nicht erwähnt)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>110265006 (Postoperative hemorrhage (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>OES (Ösophagitis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>16761005 (Esophagitis (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PPA (Periphere Parese)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">kein äquivalenter SNOMED-Term, ggfs. über Postkoordination möglich</td></tr><tr><td>OSM (Osteitis, Osteomyelitis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>274144001 (Bone inflammatory disease (disorder))</td><td>Spezifische Kodierung für Knochenentzündung</td></tr><tr><td/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>60168000 (Osteomyelitis (disorder))</td><td>Spezifische Kodierung für Knochenmarksentzündung</td></tr><tr><td>PAF (Pankreasfistel)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>25803005 (Pancreatic fistula (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PIT (Pankreatitis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>75694006 (Pancreatitis (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PAB (Peranale Blutung)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>6072007 (Bleeding from anus (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PAV (Peripherer arterieller Verschluss (Embolie, Thrombose))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>399957001 (Peripheral arterial occlusive disease (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PER (Peritonitis)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>48661000 (Peritonitis (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PLB (Platzbauch)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>698817002 (Dehiscence of postoperative abdominal wound (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PEY (Pleuraempyem)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>58554001 (Empyema of pleura (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PLE (Pleuraerguss)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>60046008 (Pleural effusion (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PMN (Pneumonie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>233604007 (Pneumonia (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PNT (Pneumothorax)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>36118008 (Pneumothorax (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PDA (Protrahierte Darmatonie (paralytischer Ileus))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1162567000 (Postoperative paralytic ileus (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PAE (Pulmonalarterienembolie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>59282003 (Pulmonary embolism (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>RPA (Rekurrensparese)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>1052240009 (Paresis of right vocal cord (disorder))</td><td>Kein gemeinsamer Überbegriff</td></tr><tr><td>RIN (Respiratorische Insuffizienz)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>409623005 (Respiratory insufficiency (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>SKI (Septische Komplikation eines Implantates)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>19220005 (Complication of implant (disorder))</td><td>Komplikation hat keine spezifischen Sepsis-Unterkonzepte, ggfs. über Postkoordination</td></tr><tr><td>SES (Septischer Schock)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></