p.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>233604007 (Pneumonia (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PNT (Pneumothorax)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>36118008 (Pneumothorax (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PDA (Protrahierte Darmatonie (paralytischer Ileus))</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>1162567000 (Postoperative paralytic ileus (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>PAE (Pulmonalarterienembolie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>59282003 (Pulmonary embolism (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>RPA (Rekurrensparese)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#narrower\" title=\"narrower\">narrower</a></td><td>1052240009 (Paresis of right vocal cord (disorder))</td><td>Kein gemeinsamer Überbegriff</td></tr><tr><td>RIN (Respiratorische Insuffizienz)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>409623005 (Respiratory insufficiency (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>SKI (Septische Komplikation eines Implantates)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#wider\" title=\"wider\">maps to wider concept</a></td><td>19220005 (Complication of implant (disorder))</td><td>Komplikation hat keine spezifischen Sepsis-Unterkonzepte, ggfs. über Postkoordination</td></tr><tr><td>SES (Septischer Schock)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>76571007 (Septic shock (disorder))</td><td/></tr><tr><td>SFH (Störungen des Flüssigkeits-, Elektrolyt- und Säurebasenh